  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      264.45,
      401.84,
      286.45
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      300.35,
      401.86,
      322.45
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Ports Authority(Amendment) Act, No. of 2023.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      336.35,
      401.86,
      370.45
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 5 of the Sri Lanka Ports Authority Act, No. 51of 1979, is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof, asfollows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      384.35,
      401.85,
      406.45
    ],
    "text": "(1)in paragraph (d) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cCustoms; and\u201d, of the words \u201cCustoms;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      420.35,
      401.85,
      454.45
    ],
    "text": "(2)in paragraph (e) thereof, by the substitution for thewords \u201cby such Minister.\u201d, of the words \u201cby suchMinister; and\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      468.35,
      401.82,
      490.45
    ],
    "text": "(3)by the addition immediately after paragraph (e)thereof, of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      199.29,
      504.35,
      401.86,
      538.45
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(f)a representative of the Ministry of theMinister assigned the subject of Ports andShipping, nominated by such Minister.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      552.35,
      401.86,
      574.45
    ],
